sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Worker A
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant R as Reaper
  participant B as Worker B
  participant X as Effect receiver
  A->>PG: claim job (lease 30s, attempt 1)
  A->>X: deliver(job:effect) → first delivery
  Note over A: SIGKILL / freeze / node lost
  R->>PG: lease expired → retry_scheduled → queued
  B->>PG: claim job (attempt 2, new fencing token)
  B->>X: deliver(job:effect) → duplicate, absorbed
  B->>PG: complete (token 2) ✔
  opt A was only frozen and wakes up
    A->>PG: complete (token 1) ✘ rejected: stale fencing token
  end
  Note over PG,X: one outcome, one effect, deliveries ≤ attempts
